 EXAMPLES:
 
 Include the following block in "aerosolProperties" file inside constant directory. 
    
  Ex.1. Dynamic shape factor implementation
  ------------------------------------------  
  ---------For solid spherical particle---------          ---------For fractals ---------        ---------For custom ---------      
  sfparam                                                   sfparam                                sfparam
 {                                                         {                                      {   
   particleShape     solid;                                 particleShape     fractal;             particleShape     custom;
   frdim             3.0;  // can be skipped in input       frdim             1.8;                 frdim             3;
   monorad           1.0E-9; // can be skipped in input     monorad           1.0E-9;              monorad           1.0E-9;
   monorho           1000;   // can be skipped in input     monorho           1000;                monorho           1000;
 }                                                         }                                       dysfPfFm          1.5;
                                                                                                   dysfExpFm         0.0;
                                                                                                   dysfPfTr          1.5;
                                                                                                   dysfExpTr         0.0;
                                                                                                   dysfPfCont        1.5;
                                                                                                   dysfExpCont       0.0;
                                                                                                  }

Ex.2. Condensation model
  ------------------------------------------  
   Include the following block in "aerosolProperties" file inside constant directory under condensation submodel.   
  
    condensation
    {
        type        coupled;
        
        KelvinEffect        true;
        
        FuchsCorrection     true;
        DropletTemperatureCorrection true;
        SR    0.55;
        solute       NaCl;
        soluteLimit  0.357;

        heatOfVaporization
        {
            active          true;
        }
    }

 
 The activity coeffiencts  are to be defined under activityCoeff block in "thermophysicalProperties" inside constant directory.
 
 FoamFile
{
    version     2.0;
    format      ascii;
    class       dictionary;
    location    "constant";
    object      thermophysicalProperties;
}

activeSpecies
(
    Water
    NaCl
);

inactiveSpecies
(
    Air
  
);

inertSpecie Air;

phaseMixing
{
    viscosity       continuousPhase;
    conductivity    mass;
    heatCapacity    mass;
}

activityCoeff
{
   type    constant;
   Water   1.0;
   NaCl    0;
}
 
